{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 213.1838125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.21,
      "end": 1.57,
      "text": "哈喽我是小三零"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.57,
      "end": 3.69,
      "text": "今天跟你分享我的战斗经验"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 3.69,
      "end": 5.45,
      "text": "我曾经是一个豆皮脚"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 5.45,
      "end": 6.25,
      "text": "九年的豆豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 6.25,
      "end": 8.21,
      "text": "全面能让我超过三千克豆豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 8.21,
      "end": 8.85,
      "text": "它不是额头"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 8.85,
      "end": 10.25,
      "text": "我的额头非常地容易长"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 10.25,
      "end": 11.25,
      "text": "避口和豆豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 11.25,
      "end": 13.09,
      "text": "那现在给你们看一下我素严"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 13.09,
      "end": 14.33,
      "text": "现在是我标击传惯夫"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 14.33,
      "end": 16.53,
      "text": "然后还没有参访上的皮膚"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 17.61,
      "end": 18.97,
      "text": "是不是还挺心力的"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 18.97,
      "end": 20.61,
      "text": "那接下来我就跟你分享"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 20.61,
      "end": 21.73,
      "text": "我是用了什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 22.25,
      "end": 24.01,
      "text": "那第一点就是身份清潔"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 24.01,
      "end": 26.17,
      "text": "我每周会做一到两次身份清潔"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 26.17,
      "end": 27.53,
      "text": "那身份清潔并不是说"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 27.53,
      "end": 29.25,
      "text": "用一个清潔面模就OK了"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 29.25,
      "end": 31.25,
      "text": "清潔面模是没有办法把你毛孔里的"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 31.25,
      "end": 33.01,
      "text": "髒东西都给你清出来的"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 33.01,
      "end": 34.85,
      "text": "那那些人髒东西你不管他清出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 34.85,
      "end": 36.37,
      "text": "他会就会躲在你的毛孔"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 36.37,
      "end": 37.65,
      "text": "让你外面的东西又进不去"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 37.65,
      "end": 38.53,
      "text": "里面的东西出过来"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 38.53,
      "end": 40.21,
      "text": "九二九支他就形成了闭口了"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 40.21,
      "end": 41.41,
      "text": "那对我多年那么总结了"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 41.41,
      "end": 42.37,
      "text": "一泡非常有用的"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 42.37,
      "end": 43.65,
      "text": "是曾经解大法"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 43.65,
      "end": 44.61,
      "text": "这方法呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 44.61,
      "end": 45.89,
      "text": "你没有愿意什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 45.89,
      "end": 47.17,
      "text": "海苗秀了大气泡小气泡"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 47.17,
      "end": 47.97,
      "text": "都要好用"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 47.97,
      "end": 49.41,
      "text": "自从我用了这个方法之后"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 49.41,
      "end": 50.77,
      "text": "我的毛孔"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 50.77,
      "end": 51.65,
      "text": "它就干净了了"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 51.65,
      "end": 52.21,
      "text": "是九十"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 52.21,
      "end": 53.33,
      "text": "而且我的黑头也检少了"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 53.33,
      "end": 54.29,
      "text": "咱们这九十"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 54.29,
      "end": 55.01,
      "text": "那你毛孔"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 55.01,
      "end": 55.53,
      "text": "一干净"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 55.53,
      "end": 56.29,
      "text": "它就会显得很小心"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 56.29,
      "end": 57.81,
      "text": "那你的皮膚非常的吸引你"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 57.81,
      "end": 59.09,
      "text": "它清潔一次可以让你的"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 59.09,
      "end": 60.29,
      "text": "肌膚味十好几天"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 60.29,
      "end": 61.81,
      "text": "都是干净的"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 61.81,
      "end": 62.45,
      "text": "这方法呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 62.45,
      "end": 63.73,
      "text": "它很经济时会"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 63.73,
      "end": 65.01,
      "text": "比美容愿办法要"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 65.01,
      "end": 65.73,
      "text": "麻烦多拉"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 65.73,
      "end": 66.45,
      "text": "你们可以关注我"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 66.45,
      "end": 67.17,
      "text": "之后我都会分享"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 67.17,
      "end": 68.61,
      "text": "在我的主店里面的"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 68.61,
      "end": 69.73,
      "text": "那第二点就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 69.73,
      "end": 70.93,
      "text": "你可以考虑"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 70.93,
      "end": 71.97,
      "text": "把酸类的产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 71.97,
      "end": 73.17,
      "text": "加入到你的日常"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 73.17,
      "end": 74.21,
      "text": "护服当中来"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 74.21,
      "end": 75.41,
      "text": "我之前都是会去皮膚"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 75.41,
      "end": 75.81,
      "text": "准备做"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 75.81,
      "end": 77.25,
      "text": "灌抚或者是做几光"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 77.25,
      "end": 78.37,
      "text": "那我做完了"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 78.37,
      "end": 79.17,
      "text": "之后是有效果的"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 79.17,
      "end": 80.13,
      "text": "但是没过几天"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 80.13,
      "end": 81.73,
      "text": "我的闭口又长出来了"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 81.73,
      "end": 82.77,
      "text": "那我的医生呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 82.77,
      "end": 83.97,
      "text": "它就会给我开你"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 83.97,
      "end": 85.33,
      "text": "种酸类的精华让我使用"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 85.33,
      "end": 86.13,
      "text": "我发现"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 86.13,
      "end": 87.33,
      "text": "它是给我开视上"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 87.33,
      "end": 87.89,
      "text": "我用几天"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 87.89,
      "end": 88.69,
      "text": "然后停几天"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 88.69,
      "end": 89.49,
      "text": "都发了我一"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 89.49,
      "end": 89.97,
      "text": "停几天"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 89.97,
      "end": 90.77,
      "text": "我就又会长立口"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 90.77,
      "end": 91.65,
      "text": "然后这想说呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 91.65,
      "end": 92.77,
      "text": "我是一项每天都用酸"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 92.77,
      "end": 93.41,
      "text": "怎么样呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 93.41,
      "end": 94.53,
      "text": "然后我就发现"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 94.53,
      "end": 95.57,
      "text": "照顾减出几的好"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 95.57,
      "end": 96.05,
      "text": "发酸"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 96.05,
      "end": 97.01,
      "text": "在加上身层清潔"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 97.01,
      "end": 97.65,
      "text": "就可以把我的"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 97.65,
      "end": 98.21,
      "text": "立口度觉得"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 98.21,
      "end": 99.01,
      "text": "就是九十"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 99.01,
      "end": 100.21,
      "text": "皮膚非常的光滑"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 100.21,
      "end": 100.77,
      "text": "健康"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 100.77,
      "end": 102.05,
      "text": "而且还变白了"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 102.61,
      "end": 103.09,
      "text": "点了门"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 103.09,
      "end": 103.81,
      "text": "你们不要一上"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 103.81,
      "end": 104.85,
      "text": "一上来就整个那种"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 104.85,
      "end": 106.45,
      "text": "大大梦的酸类的精华"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 106.45,
      "end": 107.41,
      "text": "这个就是你"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 107.41,
      "end": 108.45,
      "text": "一定要根据自己的皮膚"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 108.45,
      "end": 110.37,
      "text": "那一上情况来选择一个合适的酸"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 110.37,
      "end": 110.85,
      "text": "那我呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 110.85,
      "end": 112.05,
      "text": "就是用的是一个"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 112.05,
      "end": 113.01,
      "text": "六酸的精华"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 113.01,
      "end": 113.89,
      "text": "我用过"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 113.89,
      "end": 115.25,
      "text": "好多好多的酸啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 115.25,
      "end": 116.13,
      "text": "然后用下来之后"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 116.13,
      "end": 116.61,
      "text": "我发现"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 116.61,
      "end": 117.49,
      "text": "它是最适合我的"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 117.49,
      "end": 118.53,
      "text": "我每天都会用它"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 118.53,
      "end": 119.17,
      "text": "用的一滴"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 119.17,
      "end": 120.21,
      "text": "上在我的皮膚"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 120.21,
      "end": 120.77,
      "text": "脂肤掌制成的"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 120.77,
      "end": 121.41,
      "text": "掉后的去"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 121.41,
      "end": 121.97,
      "text": "放上起来"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 121.97,
      "end": 122.21,
      "text": "我用"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 122.21,
      "end": 122.77,
      "text": "你看"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 122.77,
      "end": 123.33,
      "text": "就是感觉"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 123.33,
      "end": 124.05,
      "text": "哦皮膚在发光"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 124.05,
      "end": 124.85,
      "text": "就这样子"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 124.85,
      "end": 126.29,
      "text": "不一定要跟我用一样的酸啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 126.29,
      "end": 126.85,
      "text": "我就是给你们"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 126.85,
      "end": 127.25,
      "text": "一个建议"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 127.25,
      "end": 128.13,
      "text": "就是在日常生活中"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 128.13,
      "end": 129.25,
      "text": "加一点酸"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 129.25,
      "end": 129.97,
      "text": "那第三点"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 129.97,
      "end": 130.53,
      "text": "我就想跟你们"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 130.53,
      "end": 131.49,
      "text": "想一个超级"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 131.49,
      "end": 132.69,
      "text": "去斗大宝放"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 132.69,
      "end": 133.33,
      "text": "就是这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 133.33,
      "end": 134.21,
      "text": "斗斗水"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 134.21,
      "end": 136.21,
      "text": "它应该是一个法国的品牌办"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 136.21,
      "end": 137.25,
      "text": "我是看博主"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 137.25,
      "end": 137.97,
      "text": "彭包子推荐"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 137.97,
      "end": 139.25,
      "text": "然后去买了"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 139.25,
      "end": 139.73,
      "text": "买了之后"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 139.73,
      "end": 141.01,
      "text": "我就好后回啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 141.01,
      "end": 142.85,
      "text": "我没有早一点去买它呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 142.85,
      "end": 144.93,
      "text": "它对于这种红种大豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 144.93,
      "end": 146.29,
      "text": "效果就是非常好"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 146.29,
      "end": 147.09,
      "text": "它不是说"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 147.09,
      "end": 147.65,
      "text": "治标啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 147.65,
      "end": 148.21,
      "text": "它是治本"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 148.21,
      "end": 148.85,
      "text": "你用了它"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 148.85,
      "end": 149.81,
      "text": "大概用你一段时间"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 149.81,
      "end": 151.09,
      "text": "就会发现你不长了"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 151.09,
      "end": 151.97,
      "text": "那种红种大豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 151.97,
      "end": 152.77,
      "text": "你就不长了"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 152.77,
      "end": 154.21,
      "text": "跟你就没关系了"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 154.21,
      "end": 155.41,
      "text": "如果是喜欢"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 155.41,
      "end": 157.33,
      "text": "莫名其妙长那种红种大豆的名声"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 157.33,
      "end": 158.37,
      "text": "你们可以试一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 158.37,
      "end": 159.57,
      "text": "它这个效果真的是"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 159.57,
      "end": 160.77,
      "text": "非常非常的厉害"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 160.77,
      "end": 162.13,
      "text": "那我发现它不只是"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 162.13,
      "end": 163.25,
      "text": "对于红种大豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": 163.25,
      "end": 165.49,
      "text": "它对于那种黑头也很有作用"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": 165.49,
      "end": 165.97,
      "text": "我用了它"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 165.97,
      "end": 168.21,
      "text": "超红的黑头就点熟好多好多"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": 168.21,
      "end": 169.17,
      "text": "你们可以去试一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": 169.17,
      "end": 169.73,
      "text": "这一平呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": 169.73,
      "end": 170.53,
      "text": "它不便宜"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": 170.53,
      "end": 171.89,
      "text": "它是50毫升式"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "start": 171.89,
      "end": 173.33,
      "text": "我买来试用七百块钱"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "start": 173.33,
      "end": 175.17,
      "text": "但是它非常非常的金融"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "start": 175.17,
      "end": 176.37,
      "text": "我用了两个月了"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "start": 176.37,
      "end": 177.57,
      "text": "把菜用到这里"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "start": 177.57,
      "end": 179.57,
      "text": "我到往上看是有分装卖的"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "start": 179.57,
      "end": 181.09,
      "text": "好像是10毫升台"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "start": 181.09,
      "end": 181.97,
      "text": "一上百块钱吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "start": 181.97,
      "end": 183.65,
      "text": "你们可以先去买分装试一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "start": 184.21,
      "end": 185.01,
      "text": "那最后演呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "start": 185.01,
      "end": 187.25,
      "text": "就是面商一定要非常的精爽"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "start": 187.25,
      "end": 189.01,
      "text": "不要再使用那些"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "start": 189.01,
      "end": 189.97,
      "text": "非常厚重的"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "start": 189.97,
      "end": 191.81,
      "text": "师傅类的面商徒代臉上了"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "start": 191.81,
      "end": 193.89,
      "text": "我们是豆子温不是敏感机"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "start": 193.89,
      "end": 195.65,
      "text": "你越轰了你逼口就越多"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "start": 195.65,
      "end": 198.37,
      "text": "可以使用这种质疊非常清爽的"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "start": 198.77,
      "end": 199.41,
      "text": "看"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "start": 199.41,
      "end": 201.17,
      "text": "敏怒质疊的这种面刷"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "start": 201.17,
      "end": 203.41,
      "text": "都比非常地友好一点都不温度"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "start": 204.21,
      "end": 206.21,
      "text": "那我的据到小明明已经非常完喽"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "start": 206.21,
      "end": 207.09,
      "text": "你们打开试试来吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "start": 207.09,
      "end": 208.13,
      "text": "记得来给我打块哦"
    }
  ]
}